  "presentation": "FTMO was established in Prague in 2015 and is one of the oldest prop firms still trading. It is not a broker and takes no deposits: every account it opens is a simulated account with fictitious funds, mirroring real market conditions. The rewards paid on the profits made there are real.\n\nThe firm says it serves more than 4.5 million traders across 140 countries, has paid over $650 million in rewards, and employs a team of more than 250 people.\n\nTwo lines sit side by side. The CFD challenges cover forex, indices, metals, energies, crypto and stocks, in one phase or two, with a Swing account type that keeps trading through the news and the weekend. FTMO Futures, launched in 2026, trades CME contracts on a monthly subscription.",
