  "verdict": {
    "texte": "Ten years in business, rules documented to the dollar and support in 21 languages: FTMO is the reference the rest of the market is compared to. The 2-Step is the most forgiving evaluation and refunds its fee; the 1-Step is faster and pays 90% straight away, in exchange for a trailing loss limit and a best-day rule. The Swing account is one of the few that lets you hold through the news and the weekend once funded. It is not the cheapest route, there is no free reset, and the futures line is young.",
